# Control API + in-process bot runner: RUNTIME dependencies (what Render / Docker install).
# Edit THIS file, then regenerate the hashed lock (see the header of requirements.txt):
#   uv pip compile control_api/requirements.in --universal --python-version 3.11 \
#       --generate-hashes --exclude-newer <today minus 14 days> -o control_api/requirements.txt
# --exclude-newer skips releases younger than 2 weeks (fresh-compromise window). Install with
#   pip install --require-hashes -r control_api/requirements.txt
# (pip-tools works too: pip-compile --generate-hashes ... but run it on Linux / Python 3.11
#  so platform-only wheels such as uvloop are included.)
